# Licensing

This repository contains two kinds of material, licensed separately. The split is the usual one for
a research artifact: permissive terms for the code so it can be reused and re-run, and a
text licence for the manuscript so the writing is attributed if it is redistributed.

## 1. Code, specifications, data and generated tables — MIT

Everything under `code/`, `scripts/`, `spec/`, `results/`, `artifact/`, `template/`, `Makefile`,
and the generated files under `paper/generated/` is released under the MIT Licence:

```
